<title>ARGENTINA: Central Costanera 1996 net rises 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Central Costanera 1996 net rises 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec. 31, 1996</p>
<p>Net $48.0 million vs $40.9 million</p>
<p>Operating $75.7 million vs $52.6 million</p>
<p>Shr $0.36 vs $0.30</p>
<p>ADR $3.60 vs $3.0</p>
<p>Three months to Dec. 31, 1996</p>
<p>Net $9.74 million vs $11.1 million</p>
<p>NOTE - Buenos Aires generator Central Costanera SA said the increase in profit for the year resulted from increased generating capacity, while the drop in fourth-quarter profit was the result of higher income tax.</p>
<p>(( -- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0695))</p>
</text>
